{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3489","id":4616824158,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz888AAAABEy8lXg","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3489","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3489.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3489.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3489","number":3489,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"db: guard argon2 verification against corrupt hash parameters","user":{"login":"iSerganov","id":41109559,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTA5NTU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41109559?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov","html_url":"https://github.com/iSerganov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`verifySecret` read `time/memory/threads` straight out of the stored PHC string and passed them to argon2.IDKey unchecked. A row written as `m=0,t=0,p=0` parsed cleanly and then panicked inside `argon2.IDKey`, permanently burning a slot from the argon2Limiter semaphore since the release wasn't deferred; enough corrupt rows would deadlock all OAuth authentication. A row with a very large `m=` could also drive an unbounded allocation.\r\n\r\nValidate time, threads and memory against zero and a new `argon2MaxMemory` ceiling before calling `argon2.IDKey`, and release the semaphore slot with defer so a panic can't leak it.\r\n\r\n\r\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [ ] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [x] added unit tests\r\n- [ ] added integration tests\r\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [ ] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2026-09-23T17:50:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T15:45:12Z","closed_at":"2026-09-25T12:58:13Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"17233627cdc6dce10fc39fbfe9fb54eb7cd484f2","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"ht